<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Hylsamex obtains QS-9000 quality rating.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Hylsamex obtains QS-9000 quality rating.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican steel company Hylsamex said on Tuesday it had obtained the QS-9000 rating for its flat steel division.</p>
<p>It said the rating was a requisite for suppliers of the U.S. automotive industry.</p>
<p>&quot;Our flat steel division ... is the first steel firm in Latin America and the seventh in the world to obtain the quality rating QS-9000,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez Whitaker, Monterrey newsroom +528 345-7617))</p>
